---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Get involved" description="Find your path with Back2School Africa as a learner, parent, tutor, mentor, volunteer, partner or donor.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap narrow"><span class="eyebrow">Get involved</span><h1>Every next step is stronger together.</h1><p class="lead">Whether you are looking for learning support or hoping to offer it, there is a place to begin.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap involvement-list"><article id="learners"><div class="involvement-index">01 / Learn</div><div><h2>Learners & parents</h2><p>Explore the programme areas, from reading and tutoring to guidance on study and career pathways. Tutor Mentor Connect brings online learning support into the picture.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="/programmes/">Explore programmes ↗</a><a href="/tutor-mentor-connect/">Tutor Mentor Connect ↗</a></div></div></article><article id="tutors-mentors"><div class="involvement-index">02 / Share knowledge</div><div><h2>Tutors & mentors</h2><p>Subject tutors, language supporters and professional mentors can help learners see new possibilities. Learn what Tutor Mentor Connect covers, then use the confirmed contact channel when available.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="/tutor-mentor-connect/">Explore the ecosystem ↗</a><a href="/contact/">Contact information ↗</a></div></div></article><article id="volunteers"><div class="involvement-index">03 / Give time</div><div><h2>Volunteers</h2><p>Community learning also needs people who can share time, skills and care. Explore the programmes to see where your experience may fit.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="/programmes/">Explore programmes ↗</a><a href="/contact/">Contact information ↗</a></div></div></article><article id="partners"><div class="involvement-index">04 / Build together</div><div><h2>Partners & donors</h2><p>Organisations and supporters can help strengthen educational opportunities. Get in touch to discuss a partnership; a verified donation channel will appear here when confirmed.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="/contact/">Contact information ↗</a>{siteConfig.donationUrl && <a href={siteConfig.donationUrl}>Donate ↗</a>}</div></div></article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
